        },
        "text_giqHAz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As an active-duty service member or military spouse, you may be eligible for a free or discounted breast pump through TRICARE and other military insurance plans. TRICARE coverage ensures that new and expectant mothers have access to high-quality breast pumps. Ameda is committed to supporting military families by making it easy to access the breastfeeding supplies you need. Our process ensures that you receive a hospital-grade breast pump when you need it.</p>",
