          "settings": {
            "enable_media": false,
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Submit The Contact Form",
            "text": "<p>To get started, complete our quick and easy contact form. This step helps us collect your basic information to verify your TRICARE coverage and determine your eligibility for a TRICARE-covered breast pump. Once submitted, our team will process your request and move forward with your order.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--21965917618491__70b6796a-4aa7-4791-9ea6-72e90afed64c-column-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": false,
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Provide Military Insurance Information",
            "text": "<p>After we receive your form, we may need additional details to confirm your TRICARE breast pump coverage. This may include:</p><ul><li><strong>Proof of TRICARE coverage, such as an ID or policy details</strong></li><li><strong>A breast pump prescription from a TRICARE-authorized doctor, nurse practitioner, or midwife</strong></li><li><strong>Listing your OBGYN or midwife</strong></li></ul><p>Our team will handle all the necessary paperwork, working together with a TRICARE authorized provider, to ensure a smooth process while maintaining your privacy and security.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--21965917618491__70b6796a-4aa7-4791-9ea6-72e90afed64c-column-3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": false,
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "We Contact You with Your Options",
            "text": "<p>Once approved, an Ameda representative will reach out to you to discuss your options, including the most popular breast pumps available through TRICARE coverage. Whether you need a hospital-grade pump, a standard electric pump, or a portable pump, we’ll help you select the best option for your breastfeeding needs. Your TRICARE-covered breast pump will then be shipped directly to you at no cost.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
